  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-116189",
  "summary": "rclone 1.55.0 before 1.75.2 selfupdate Signature Verification Bypass via SHA256SUMS",
  "details": "rclone from 1.55.0 before 1.75.2 contains a signature verification bypass in stable selfupdate that trusts checksums from unsigned bytes preceding the PGP-clearsigned SHA256SUMS block. Attackers controlling the release distribution path can prepend an unsigned checksum line matching a malicious archive, causing selfupdate to install an attacker-controlled rclone executable.",
  "aliases": [
    "CVE-2026-116189"
